{"title":"Nickel","sourceTitle":"Nickel/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Nickel/de\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Nickel (30% translated)\" lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">Deutsch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Nickel\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Nickel (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Nickel/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Nickel (30% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Nickel/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Никель (30% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Nickel/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"镍 (60% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:300px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Níquel</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ingot-nickel.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/3/33/Ingot-nickel.png/100px-Ingot-nickel.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/3/33/Ingot-nickel.png/150px-Ingot-nickel.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/3/33/Ingot-nickel.png/200px-Ingot-nickel.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Empilhável</b>\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"TC\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Fundível</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Ponto de cheiro</b>\n</td>\n<td>1325°C\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Requer contêiner</b>\n</td>\n<td>Sim\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Saída</b>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Ingot_mold\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Ingot mold\">Molde de lingote</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Valor de saída</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Items\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Itens</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p><b>Níquel</b> é usado com <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/copper\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/copper\">cobre</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Copper\" title=\"Copper\"> </a></span> para fazer a liga <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/cupronickel\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/cupronickel\">cuproníquel</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cupronickel\" title=\"Cupronickel\"> </a></span>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Obtenção\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Obtenção</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Minérios\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Minérios</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Uso\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Uso</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Casting\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Casting</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Smithing\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Smithing</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Ligas_metálicas\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Ligas metálicas</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Histórico\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Histórico</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Galeria\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Galeria</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Referências\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Referências</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<p><span id=\"Obtaining\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Obten.C3.A7.C3.A3o\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtenção\">Obtenção</span></h2>\n<p><span id=\"Ores\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Min.C3.A9rios\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Minérios\">Minérios</span></h3>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>O minério principal de níquel é a <b>pentlandita</b>. A pentlandita pode ser encontrada em depósitos profundos de andesito, granito, basalto e peridotito. Os depósitos de peridotito são os únicos que podem conter pentlandita rica e abundante.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p>Pentlandite deposits generate at an elevation between 0 and 0.4 of the surface. The height of the surface varies across different terrain and is estimated to be Y-level 120 on average in a world with default height settings. Pentlandite can range from Y-level 0 to Y-level 48. The deposit is disc-shaped with a radius of 6 to 12 blocks and a thickness of 1 to 3 blocks. Pentlandite has 5 tries per chunk to generate, making it very rare.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"width: 400px; text-align: center;\">\n<caption><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Pentlandite in host rock</span>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Rock</span>\n</th>\n<th><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Normal block</span>\n</th>\n<th><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Ore block</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Andesite</span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Rock-andesite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/b/ba/Rock-andesite.png/100px-Rock-andesite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/ba/Rock-andesite.png/150px-Rock-andesite.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/b/ba/Rock-andesite.png/200px-Rock-andesite.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-pentlandite-andesite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/7/78/Ore-pentlandite-andesite.png/100px-Ore-pentlandite-andesite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/7/78/Ore-pentlandite-andesite.png/150px-Ore-pentlandite-andesite.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/7/78/Ore-pentlandite-andesite.png/200px-Ore-pentlandite-andesite.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Basalt</span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Rock-basalt.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/b/bb/Rock-basalt.png/100px-Rock-basalt.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/bb/Rock-basalt.png/150px-Rock-basalt.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/b/bb/Rock-basalt.png/200px-Rock-basalt.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-pentlandite-basalt.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/c/c1/Ore-pentlandite-basalt.png/100px-Ore-pentlandite-basalt.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/c/c1/Ore-pentlandite-basalt.png/150px-Ore-pentlandite-basalt.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/c/c1/Ore-pentlandite-basalt.png/200px-Ore-pentlandite-basalt.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Granite</span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Rock-granite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/8/89/Rock-granite.png/100px-Rock-granite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/8/89/Rock-granite.png/150px-Rock-granite.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/8/89/Rock-granite.png/200px-Rock-granite.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-pentlandite-granite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/e/e6/Ore-pentlandite-granite.png/100px-Ore-pentlandite-granite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/e/e6/Ore-pentlandite-granite.png/150px-Ore-pentlandite-granite.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/e/e6/Ore-pentlandite-granite.png/200px-Ore-pentlandite-granite.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Peridotite</span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Rock-peridotite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/3/3d/Rock-peridotite.png/100px-Rock-peridotite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/3/3d/Rock-peridotite.png/150px-Rock-peridotite.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/3/3d/Rock-peridotite.png/200px-Rock-peridotite.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-pentlandite-peridotite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/a/a8/Ore-pentlandite-peridotite.png/100px-Ore-pentlandite-peridotite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/a/a8/Ore-pentlandite-peridotite.png/150px-Ore-pentlandite-peridotite.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/a/a8/Ore-pentlandite-peridotite.png/200px-Ore-pentlandite-peridotite.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>O minério de níquel pode ser <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/mining\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/mining\">minerado</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Mining\" title=\"Mining\"> </a></span> com uma <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/pickaxe\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/pickaxe\">picareta</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Pickaxe\" title=\"Pickaxe\"> </a></span> de nível 4 (Ferro).\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><span id=\"Usage\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Uso\">Uso</span></h2>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Casting\">Casting</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<dl><dd><i>See also: <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Casting\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Casting\">Casting</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Casting\" title=\"Casting\"> </a></span></i></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>Devido à sua alta temperatura de fusão, apenas <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/coke\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/coke\">coque</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Coke\" title=\"Coke\"> </a></span> pode ser usado como combustível para derretê-lo. Também pode ser derretido em um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/bloomery\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/bloomery\">Forno de lupa</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bloomery\" title=\"Bloomery\"> </a></span> se não houver coque disponível.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Smithing\">Smithing</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<dl><dd><i>See also: <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Smithing\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Smithing\">Smithing</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Smithing\" title=\"Smithing\"> </a></span></i></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p>Nickel ingots can only be smithed into nickel <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Plate\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Plate\">plates</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Plate\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Plate\"> </a></span>; when placed on an <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Anvil\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Anvil\">anvil</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Anvil\" title=\"Anvil\"> </a></span>, no dialog box to select an item will appear. Nickel requires a tier 2 anvil (<a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bronze\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bronze\">bronze</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bronze\" title=\"Bronze\"> </a></span> or higher) and has a workable temperature of 663°C. Nickel plates are exclusively used to craft <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Riveted_metal_block\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Riveted metal block\">riveted nickel blocks</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Riveted_metal_block\" title=\"Riveted metal block\"> </a></span>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><span id=\"Alloys\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Ligas_met.C3.A1licas\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ligas_metálicas\">Ligas metálicas</span></h3>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>O níquel é um ingrediente secundário do cuproníquel (ligado com <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/copper\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/copper\">cobre</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Copper\" title=\"Copper\"> </a></span>).\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n<caption>Ligas de níquel\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Image</span></th>\n<th><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Name</span></th>\n<th><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Nickel&#160;%</span></th>\n<th><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Other metal&#160;%</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ingot-cupronickel.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/5/5c/Ingot-cupronickel.png/50px-Ingot-cupronickel.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/5c/Ingot-cupronickel.png/75px-Ingot-cupronickel.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/5c/Ingot-cupronickel.png/100px-Ingot-cupronickel.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Cupronickel\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Cupronickel\">Cuproníquel</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cupronickel\" title=\"Cupronickel\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>25-35%</td>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Copper\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Copper\">Cobre</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Copper\" title=\"Copper\"> </a></span></span>: 65-75%\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p><span id=\"History\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Hist.C3.B3rico\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Histórico\">Histórico</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r285111\">.mw-parser-output .history th[scope=col]{background-color:#5E462A;color:#EAD3B3;border:2px solid #382b1e;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .history td{border:transparent}.mw-parser-output .history th[scope=row]{background-color:#D1B296;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .history tr:nth-child(2n/**/+1) td{background-color:#CCBCAB}.mw-parser-output .history tr:nth-child(2n) td{background-color:#E0CFBB}</style>\n<strong class=\"error\"><span class=\"scribunto-error mw-scribunto-error-112edf4d\">Lua error in Module:History at line 30: attempt to index local &#39;version&#39; (a nil value).</span></strong><table class=\"wikitable history\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\">Versão\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Descrição\n</th></tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span id=\"Gallery\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Galeria\">Galeria</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-nolines\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 125px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 120px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Nugget-pentlandite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Pentlandite nugget\"><img alt=\"Pentlandite nugget\" src=\"/images/thumb/f/fd/Nugget-pentlandite.png/120px-Nugget-pentlandite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/f/fd/Nugget-pentlandite.png/180px-Nugget-pentlandite.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/f/fd/Nugget-pentlan